Description: Zovelis OS artwork: logos, wallpapers and boot screens
 The visual identity of Zovelis OS:
  * the Zovelis logo and application icons (hicolor theme),
  * the "Zovelis" wallpaper with light and dark variants,
  * a Plymouth boot splash, including the disk-unlock prompt,
  * a GRUB boot menu theme.
 .
 The Plasma global themes and the login screen that use this artwork are in
 zovelis-desktop-settings.
